cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "geomapclean: clean, labelled maps from raw GIS files"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-06"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Moses-L/geomapclean"
abstract: >-
  An open-source Python tool and web app that turns raw GIS files (zipped shapefiles,
  GeoJSON, GeoPackage, KML) into publication-ready maps with automatic projection,
  geometry repair, collision-free labels, classed legends, scale bar, north arrow and graticule.
keywords: [GIS, cartography, choropleth, shapefile, public health, epidemiology, mapping]
authors:
  - family-names: Luke
    given-names: Moses
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0600-6660"
